[node name="RoomJ" type="Node2D"]
editor_description = "HARD glide gauntlet (Stage 5). One long scrolling updraft over spikes: riding updrafts is free, so stamina never matters. Gliding always rises (into the ceiling spikes), so you bob: release to drop, re-press to catch. Spiked blocks force you high or low. Updraft strength varies: 60, 90, 40, 90, 60."
